    {
      "id": "F13",
      "statement": "Shared devices on paths. A-10859: device D-79802 was used to send by A-10859 and A-78340, which are the alerted account and its first onward account. A-37573: device D-45880 was used to send by A-37573, A-38045, A-93288 and A-63022, which are every path account that sent anything; all 8 onward transfers on its paths came from D-45880. A-83577: device D-40018 was used to send by A-83094 and A-14799, which are not adjacent on the path; account A-34114, which is not on the path, also sent from D-40018. The A-20636, A-28137 and A-85921 alerts have no device used by two or more of their path accounts. A-36729 (on the A-20636 path) shares device D-30793 with A-69026, which is not on that path.",
